    "status": "Pending. Plan filed August 2026; remaining businesses being sold or wound down.",
    "summary": "Once the second-largest wine and spirits distributor in the US, RNDC ran short of cash, fell behind with suppliers and could not refinance. It sold 11 markets to Reyes Holdings for more than $1 billion in May 2026, then filed to sell what was left and wind down the rest.",
